 Jobs in this run (in execution order):
 * Hartree-Fock calculation
===========================================================================
 SCFINP: Set-up for Hartree-Fock calculation:
===========================================================================
 * Number of fermion irreps: 1
 * Closed shell SCF calculation with   10 electrons in
       5 orbitals in Fermion irrep 1
 * Bare nucleus screening correction used for start guess
 * General print level   :   0
 ***** TRIAL FUNCTION *****
 * Trial vectors read from file DFCOEF
 ***** CONVERGENCE CRITERIA *****
 * Convergence on norm of error vector (gradient).
   Desired convergence:1.000D-07
   Allowed convergence:1.000D-06

 ***** CONVERGENCE CONTROL *****
 * Fock matrix constructed using differential density matrix
    with optimal parameter.
 * DIIS (in MO basis)
 * DIIS will be activated when convergence reaches : 1.00D+20
   - Maximum size of B-matrix:   10
 * Damping of Fock matrix when DIIS is not activated. 
   Weight of old matrix    : 0.250
 * Maximum number of SCF iterations  :   50
 * No quadratic convergent Hartree-Fock
 * Contributions from 2-electron integrals to Fock matrix:
   LL-integrals.
   SL-integrals from iteration    1
 ***** OUTPUT CONTROL *****
 * Only electron eigenvalues written out.


   ***************************************************************************
   ***************************** Analysis module *****************************
   ***************************************************************************

 Jobs in this run:
 * Mulliken population analysis
 * Molecular orbital localization
===========================================================================
 LOCINP: Molecular orbital localization (Pipek-Mezey criterion)
===========================================================================
 * Molecular orbital localization from projection analysis
 * Full hessian will be used
 * Convergence criteria of the localization process :
   - If the maximum is reached (= there are no positive eigenvalues)
   - If the norm of the gradient is below threshold:  0.10D-08
 * Maximum number of iterations :   100
 * Print level :    0
 * Fragments are calculated in their individual bases !
     The indexing of fragment spinor sets is assumed 
     to follow list of symmetry independent nuclei.
 * Fragment spinor set   1 --> O     
  - read from file DFO1AT
    - Orbitals in fermion ircop E1  :1..6                                                                    
 * Fragment spinor set   2 --> H1    
  - read from file DFH1AT
    - Orbitals in fermion ircop E1  :1                                                                       
 * Fragment spinor set   3 --> H2    
  - read from file DFH2AT
    - Orbitals in fermion ircop E1  :1                                                                       
 * Localised MO are written in file DFCOEF !!!
===========================================================================
 POPINP: Mulliken population analysis
===========================================================================
 * Gross populations
 * Label definitions based on SO-labels
